  "source_code": "for i in range(int(input())):\r\n    nm=[int(j) for j in input().split()]\r\n    c=[int(j) for j in input().split()]\r\n    c=sorted(c)\r\n    l=c[0]-1\r\n    r=nm[0]-c[-1]\r\n    k=[]\r\n    for j in c:\r\n        k.append([j-l,j+r])\r\n    m=0\r\n    nm=nm[1]\r\n    for j in range(nm-1):\r\n        r1=k[j][1]+1\r\n        l2=k[j+1][0]\r\n        if r1<l2:\r\n            o=l2-r1\r\n            if o>m:\r\n                m=o\r\n    \r\n    print((2*min(l,r)) +max(l,r)+m)\r\n",
